{"4542740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dinghai: The Ocean Pillar", "steam_appid": 4542740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/30a0b48fcd578e544f4a59230f7bc29d.poster.avif?t=1788320980\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/30a0b48fcd578e544f4a59230f7bc29d.webm?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/30a0b48fcd578e544f4a59230f7bc29d.mp4?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinghai: The Ocean Pillar is an action RPG-roguelike</strong> set in the mythic world of the Classic of Mountains and Seas, where ancient gods, demons, and forgotten powers collide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Soul That Refused to Stay Dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the Abyssal Dragon, a legendary general who once served under Emperor Yan, stripped of his name, cast into exile, and slain in battle. For centuries, only a sliver of his soul survived. Now, through a forbidden curse, he seizes the body of Yi, the godson of the flood-taming hero Yu, moments before death claims them both. Reborn in a form none could have predicted, the Abyssal Dragon walks the mortal world again, carrying centuries of unfinished business and a regret that even death could not bury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/77a9256744d31e41105eec49a17fb358.poster.avif?t=1788320980\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/77a9256744d31e41105eec49a17fb358.webm?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/77a9256744d31e41105eec49a17fb358.mp4?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual Weapon Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a dual-weapon combat system, carve your way through gods, demons, and monsters drawn from ancient Eastern mythology. Every run is a fresh trial. Unlock new abilities, discover powerful combinations, and push deeper into a world that grows stranger and more dangerous the further you go. Death is never the end. Each cycle brings new understanding, new strength, and new pieces of a truth that has been buried for ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/fbff84a9db9226f266a1345dea4b13e0.poster.avif?t=1788320980\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/fbff84a9db9226f266a1345dea4b13e0.webm?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/fbff84a9db9226f266a1345dea4b13e0.mp4?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Re-live in the Mythical World of “Classic of Mountains and Seas”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world torn apart by catastrophic floods and divine conflict. Uncover the fate of Yu, the flood hero who has vanished without a trace.  And confront the question at the heart of it all: what does a soul that has survived everything still have left to fight for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/7ecfcb0cd9a1a70a374ae503682accd4.poster.avif?t=1788320980\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/7ecfcb0cd9a1a70a374ae503682accd4.webm?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/7ecfcb0cd9a1a70a374ae503682accd4.mp4?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Weapon Combat</strong> — Switch freely between two weapon types during combat, building synergies and adapting your style on the go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Depth</strong> — Every run brings new choices. Every death is a step toward something stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic World of &quot;Classic of Mountains and Seas&quot;</strong> — Navigate ancient lands steeped in lore, from storm-lashed mountains to celestial islands hidden beyond the sky.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/30a0b48fcd578e544f4a59230f7bc29d.poster.avif?t=1788320980\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/30a0b48fcd578e544f4a59230f7bc29d.webm?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/30a0b48fcd578e544f4a59230f7bc29d.mp4?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinghai: The Ocean Pillar is an action RPG-roguelike</strong> set in the mythic world of the Classic of Mountains and Seas, where ancient gods, demons, and forgotten powers collide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Soul That Refused to Stay Dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the Abyssal Dragon, a legendary general who once served under Emperor Yan, stripped of his name, cast into exile, and slain in battle. For centuries, only a sliver of his soul survived. Now, through a forbidden curse, he seizes the body of Yi, the godson of the flood-taming hero Yu, moments before death claims them both. Reborn in a form none could have predicted, the Abyssal Dragon walks the mortal world again, carrying centuries of unfinished business and a regret that even death could not bury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/77a9256744d31e41105eec49a17fb358.poster.avif?t=1788320980\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/77a9256744d31e41105eec49a17fb358.webm?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542740/extras/77a9256744d31e41105eec49a17fb358.mp4?t=1788320980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual Weapon Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a dual-weapon combat system, carve your way through gods, demons, and monsters drawn from ancient Eastern mythology. Every run is a fresh trial. Unlock new abilities, discover powerful combinations, and push deeper into a world that grows stranger and more dangerous the further you go. Death is never the end. Each cycle brings new understanding, new strength, and new pieces of a truth that has been buried for ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sh